# Everything under reference/ is either the original program's own output
# (goldens, exports, embedded data) or a fixture it was tested against. The
# tests compare those files byte for byte: the original writes LF line
# endings, stray CR bytes inside comments and trailing spaces on sequence
# lines, and all of that must survive a checkout unchanged. Never apply
# end-of-line conversion to them, whatever core.autocrlf says on the host
# (Git for Windows, and so the windows-latest CI runner, defaults to true).
reference/** -text

# Binary sequence formats, stated explicitly rather than left to detection.
*.xdna binary
*.dna  binary
